  nextButtonText: {fileID: 1336088700}
  tutorialImages:
  - {fileID: -7723878917458204143, guid: 5ca64994a4665dd4082fbff78a68510d, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 2416061620125344155, guid: b2b760810e45b454d97ee533622c0974, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -7210470214081766192, guid: 0f7598e0abad3e84fbfe536dc2ffc27d, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1805463728544329446, guid: de6633d845e74af45bd3e15afbef18ad, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1758170534792519715, guid: d01dc9fd1d5a3e049bc8c37a3978d01f, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: f15bdbce52c1dda4b8cf33ddac80a5a9, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 747492405262832995, guid: 632b6976bf2ea8945a3d09a236f0d72a, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 7837628249499518303, guid: dcfee7518cf4beb4ba43352aec40b413, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -2183872611098917974, guid: 46eaafcfc75f19147abf84b51d9d17ff, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -9119395583152971082, guid: 55b1f8bca3f0deb4b85ee3cae96ed9b7, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -6628576971146582913, guid: 87458aac8fa882f428dc64ca3ce1abc7, type: 3}
  tutorialTexts:
  - Welcome to JellyGo!
  - You are playing as The Jelly!
  - You have one head and several blocks.
  - Your job is to put your body block into a jelly cup!
  - To do that, you have to sacrifice your body. So, drag the cutter and release
    to  cut it out!
  - "Don\u2019t worry, you still can attach your body again! Just click at it once
    you are close."
  - You can also use and leave your body to trigger a pressure plate!
  - "Sometimes, you\u2019ll find a body that need to fill into spesific cup."
  - Ohh yeah, your movement and cut are limited. So, use them wisely!
  - You can replay the level everytime you need! (or if you running out of cut and
    move)
  - Fill all of the cup and win the level!
